crates/gruntas-client/src/english.txt is BIP-0039's English list of 2048 words,
unchanged. gruntas's recovery phrase writes the account key as 24 of these words
with BIP-0039's checksum; the encoding in crates/gruntas-client/src/phrase.rs is
gruntas's own.

