pi-claude-subscription — source, copied and changed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://www.npmjs.com/package/pi-claude-subscription, version 0.2.4
           (https://github.com/jkeskikangas/pi-claude-subscription)
License:   MIT
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Jarno Keskikangas

npm/pi/src/claude/ (the @gruntas/pi extension's `gruntas` provider) is copied
from it: its Claude Code session, event translation, transcript conversion,
synthesized transcripts, model catalog and helpers. gruntas changed it to start
Claude Code through `gruntas run claude --account <name> --no-plugin` on the
session's gruntas account, to keep Claude Code's own system prompt with pi's
instructions as context, and to move a session between accounts; it left out
its anchor registry and prompt rewrite. Each copied file says so at its top.

